{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["And I say: <b>For many days you shall sit</b> — the meaning is, if you wish to be mine, you shall sit for many days without prostituting yourself and without belonging to another man. The meaning: you shall not serve other Elohim in secret." "<b>And you shall not belong to a man, and I also</b> — the word 'לא' serves on account of another [verb], and the meaning is: and I also shall not come to you. And some say: if you return to Me — I also shall return to you, and this is the prophet's interpretation of the matter."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:10.028436924Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}